## Lineage

This project descends from a WebSocket-to-Telnet proxy originally written by
Plamen Arnaudov (@plamzi) in 2014, distributed as `proxy/wsproxy.js` within
MUDPortal-Web-App. It was forked and continued by Ivan Alonso (@neverbot) in
2020 as `maldorne/mud-web-proxy`, and is continued here by Andrew Goldfinch.

This fork was taken from `maldorne/mud-web-proxy` at its `v3.0.0` tag. That
upstream has since released its own `v4.0.0`, which @neverbot describes as a
full rewrite; it shares no code with this project, and the two `v4` lines are
unrelated despite the coinciding version number.

Version history recorded in the source:

    v1.3  2014-02-27  @plamzi
    v2.0              @neverbot
    v3.0  2025-03     @neverbot

